        VSS) LDO_Core
V4 (VSS 0) vsource dc=0 type=dc
V3 (VH VSS) vsource dc=2 type=dc
V1 (VREF VSS) vsource dc=1 type=dc
V0 (VIN VSS) vsource dc=1.2 mag=1 type=dc
I3 (VOUT VSS) isource dc=iload type=dc
I2 (VIN net6) isource dc=ibias type=dc
